    "findings": [
      "Both images preserve common world scale and use actual Kenney GLB source geometry.",
      "One- and two-storey examples, actual runtime-scaled trucks and 1.8m guides are visible together.",
      "The original wall-type-b has large open bands; these example assemblies are not finished enclosed buildings or working interiors.",
      "Native door-type-a at scale 3 is about 1.88m tall; the proposed usable interior doors will need explicit clearance rather than assuming the decorative source establishes it.",
      "The steep native roof adds 3m; that additional roof height must not be confused with the 3m floor-to-floor height."
    ],
    "next_step": "Review size comparison before expanding the requested modular interior kit; use the reconciled main city geometry and placement contract."
